## Method Mapping

### Client→Agent Methods

| ACP Method | Handling |
|------------|----------|
| `initialize` | Forward to agent, agent returns capabilities |
| `authenticate` | Forward to agent |
| `session/new` | Forward to agent, client stores returned sessionId |
| `session/load` | Forward to agent, may trigger event replay |
| `session/set_mode` | Forward to agent |
| `session/prompt` | Forward to agent, streaming via session/update events |
| `session/cancel` | Forward immediately as notification |

### Agent→Client Methods

| ACP Method | Handling |
|------------|----------|
| `session/update` | Agent sends MAP notification, client routes to sessionUpdate handler |
| `session/request_permission` | Agent sends MAP request, client shows UI, returns decision |
| `fs/read_text_file` | Agent sends MAP request, client reads local file |
| `fs/write_text_file` | Agent sends MAP request, client writes local file |
| `terminal/create` | Agent sends MAP request, client spawns terminal |
| `terminal/output` | Agent sends MAP request, client returns terminal output |
| `terminal/release` | Agent sends MAP request, client releases terminal |
| `terminal/wait_for_exit` | Agent sends MAP request, client awaits terminal exit |
| `terminal/kill` | Agent sends MAP request, client kills terminal process |

